  "id": "member_savings_balance",
  "version": 4,
  "name": "Member SAVINGS Balance Lookup",
  "description": "Signs in to the Northstar (Meridian Core Servicing 8.4) back-office console with supplied teller credentials, searches Member Servicing for a given Member ID, and returns the current balance of that member's SAVINGS share along with the share account number, member name and member status. Reports \"member not found\" as a normal business result.",
